==============================================================================
SECTION 7: NEURAL FIRING RATES IN RAPIDITY SPACE
==============================================================================

Neurons fire at rates 0 to ~200 Hz (max firing rate).
Normalize: x = rate / max_rate, so x in [0, 1].
Rapidity: rho = arctanh(2x - 1)

At x=0 (silent): rho -> -inf
At x=0.5 (half-max): rho = 0
At x=1 (max): rho -> +inf

  Rate(Hz)   x=rate/max   rapidity     1/(1+e^(-2*rho))
  ------------------------------------------------------------
         1      0.0050       -2.6467         0.0050
         5      0.0250       -1.8318         0.0250
        10      0.0500       -1.4722         0.0500
        20      0.1000       -1.0986         0.1000
        30      0.1500       -0.8673         0.1500
        50      0.2500       -0.5493         0.2500
        75      0.3750       -0.2554         0.3750
       100      0.5000        0.0000         0.5000
       120      0.6000        0.2027         0.6000
       150      0.7500        0.5493         0.7500
       175      0.8750        0.9730         0.8750
       190      0.9500        1.4722         0.9500
       199      0.9950        2.6467         0.9950

  The sigmoid function IS the inverse rapidity map!
  x = sigmoid(2*rho) = 1/(1+exp(-2*rho))

  This means neural sigmoid activation functions are computing
  in RAPIDITY SPACE. The sigmoid squashes rapidity -> probability,
  and the logit (= 2*rapidity) maps probability -> rapidity.

  Gain modulation in neural networks:
  If a neuron's response is y = sigmoid(g*x + b),
  then in rapidity: rho_out = g*rho_in + b/2
  Gain g SCALES rapidity. Bias b SHIFTS rapidity.
  Neural computation is AFFINE in rapidity space.

  Rate coding information efficiency:
  If a neuron can distinguish N rates in [0, max_rate],
  the rapidity resolution is delta_rho = total_range / N.

  Practical rapidity range (5-195 Hz, avoiding extremes):
    rho_lo = -1.8318 (at 5 Hz)
    rho_hi = 1.8318 (at 195 Hz)
    Total range = 3.6636 rapidity units
    At 10 distinguishable levels: delta_rho = 0.3664
    At 100 levels: delta_rho = 0.0366

